REHEARSAL = [
 ("Opening", "Start with the question, not a greeting: 'What happens when someone wants to keep their first SIP going, but their cash flow doesn't cooperate?' Pause two seconds, then slide 1."),
 ("Where to pause", "After the North Star formula; after 'drops to fourth without my weights'; before 'So I reframed the problem' on slide 7; after the closing line."),
 ("Metrics to emphasise", "19,005 → 450; κ 0.50 (11/20); 13.3 vs 2.6; 945/1,000 and 'fourth without weights'; 4/5 vs 2/5; 22/25 and 57/58; 'one participant'."),
 ("Slow down on", "Slide 7. It's the decision. Say each of the three boxes as a separate sentence."),
 ("Don't read aloud", "The limitation bullets, the score components table, the risk register cells, the footers. Point to them and summarise."),
 ("Research → product transition", "'If I'd followed the ranking, I'd have built a better failed-payment screen. The interviews told me the problem starts earlier, so the Companion explains the situation and the options, not just the failure.'"),
 ("Interruptions", "Answer briefly, then return: 'Good question; short answer is X, and slide N shows it. Let me finish this point first.'"),
 ("When you don't know", "'I don't know. What I do know is X, and the way I'd find out is Y.' Never guess a number."),
 ("Finishing", "Say the closing line, then stop talking. Offer the live demo or evidence, not a summary."),
]

